# tally 2.2.1 (#220, 220.1), E §4.1 step 2 and L §5.19 Holes: pay_x is dated w2 = window(2026-03-30, 2026-04-02);
# konto is covered through March, so on 2026-03-30 and 03-31 pay_x is modelled past and books nothing, on 04-01 and
# 04-02 it is booked: "HOLE-IMPRECISE as far as ... the other class would reach", from 04-01. The reading at 2026-03-31
# end states konto there (v0, 595.00 PLN) and its pad is 0.00 PLN on every day; the window runs past the reading, so
# bal(konto, 2026-04-05) is the hole naming w2 (v1), 595.00 PLN pinned to 03-31 (v2). tally 2.2 asked coverage day by
# day and let the reading end the hole: v1 595.00 PLN, the pad a hole (the 2.2 review's p4/cov.tally).
# tally 2.2.1 (#220, 220.2), L §8.2 One read set: v2 lists pinned: w2 and open: pay_x, the reads that decided
# pay_x doesn't count, past the reading's pad.
=== cov.tally
model g4_cov
  tally 2
  on 2026-04-20
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31
  note "G4 review probe: an observation fulfils a window-dated movement; an observed row dated by a window; residuals and check over them."

source card "invented"

unit PLN: currency minor 0.01

kind buys: transfers

place konto: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..

place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..

place unexplained: outside lives 1900-01-01..

input bank: observed

input pay: money PLN

input w: date

input w2: date

move pay_w: transfers
  on w
  leg cash from world to konto amount pay

move pay_x: transfers
  on w2
  leg cash from world to konto amount pay

version v_card
  cite card
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  pay = 100.00 PLN "c"
  w = window(2026-03-05, 2026-03-07) "c"
  w2 = window(2026-03-30, 2026-04-02) "c"
  opening[konto] = 500.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "c"

version st
  cite card
  governs 2026-03
  known 2026-04-10
  covers konto
  pad konto from unexplained
  stated[konto] = 595.00 PLN at 2026-03-31 end "s"
  bank[r1] = (on: 2026-03-06, kind: transfers, leg cash from world to konto amount 100.00 PLN, fulfils: pay_w) "r1"
  bank[r2] = (on: 2026-03-20, kind: buys, leg cash from konto to world amount 5.00 PLN) "r2"

ask v1: bal(konto, 2026-04-05)
ask v2: bal(konto, 2026-04-05) with w2 = 2026-03-31
ask v0: bal(konto, 2026-03-31)
=== expect
v0: 595.00 PLN
  pad: konto 2026-03-31 end, pads:st:konto@2026-03-31 end of 0.00 PLN
  cut 2026-04-20
v1: ?"date within window(2026-03-30, 2026-04-02) not precise enough for a balance" (pay_x)
  unknown day: w2
  pad: konto 2026-03-31 end, pads:st:konto@2026-03-31 end of 0.00 PLN
  cut 2026-04-20
v2: 595.00 PLN
  pinned: w2 = 2026-03-31
  pad: konto 2026-03-31 end, pads:st:konto@2026-03-31 end of 0.00 PLN
  open: pay_x
  cut 2026-04-20
